'''Chiseled Nether bricks''' are a decorative variant of [[Nether bricks]], crafted from [[Nether brick slab]]s.

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
Chiseled Nether bricks can be mined using any [[pickaxe]]. If mined without a pickaxe, they drop nothing.
{{breaking row|horizontal=1|Chiseled Nether Bricks|link=none|Pickaxe|Wood}}

=== Crafting ===
